  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by virtue of its siting,  height, depth, and its proximity to the rear building line and gardens of the immediately neighbouring properties, would result in an overly dominant form of development which would result in a loss of outlook and an unacceptably heightened sense of enclosure as perceived from the neighbouring properties at Nos. 1 and 2 Chase Green. In addition, in the absence of a daylight/ sunlight report the applicant has failed to demonstrate that the development will not result in an unacceptable loss of daylight/ sunlight or result in unacceptable overshadowing of the immediately neighbouring dwellings and their gardens. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD14 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
